labelled: 2026-09-29
--- code
const NONEXISTENT_SETTLEMENT_SCHEME = 'nonexistent-scheme';

export async function readsSettlementScheme(schemeId: string): Promise<boolean> {
  return requestSchemeAccess(schemeId, [{ settlementScheme: NONEXISTENT_SETTLEMENT_SCHEME }]).then(
    () => false,
    () => true,
  );
}
--- facts
Many ledgers, older mainframes among them, predate the `settlementScheme` field of the posting API and accept any value in it.
This function asks about `NONEXISTENT_SETTLEMENT_SCHEME` and returns true when the ledger refuses that scheme.
